message: If you use this code, cite picoquic.
title: picoquic 1.1.47.0 (vendored subset)
abstract: >-
  QUIC, HTTP/3 and WebTransport for the guests: picoquic/, picohttp/ and picoquic_mbedtls/ only,
  copied unmodified from the org's engine fork (entities-godot, tag
  v2026.09.19.1621-main-fabric-0.2.4, thirdparty/picoquic, last changed at a7e88a49da). That copy
  carries the fork's two patches, which load a private key from a buffer and follow mbedTLS 4.
